    }
}
```

### Key Fixes Implemented:
1) **Dynamic Gateway Resolution**  
   Uses `/proc/net/route` auto-discovery instead of hardcoded values  
   Prevents placeholder errors (`72.[...]`)  

2) **Ping Command Stability**  
   Derives source IP (`hostname -I`) and destination IPs (`awk` parsing `ip ro show`) dynamically  
   Eliminates unresolved variable failures  

3) **Policy Compliance**  
   Ensures no paths violate revenue-maximizing rules  
   Loopback advertisement ensures reverse-path viability  

### Why This Works:
Avoids hardcoding unknown values while leveraging system-level discovery mechanisms available even with incomplete topology data (`/proc/net/route`, `hostname`, `ip ro`). Strictly follows tool call protocol by isolating `report_done`.
